# sweep: --bare
# The rest of a first session: Detailed card details, every grade, leaving a
# review half way and coming back, the licences pages, the collection pushed
# again from the computer with the grades kept, and the app restarting.
wait-for No collection yet
tap Start with the sample
wait-for Choose a deck
expect Getting started
expect Not started today
# Detailed card details show the template and how often a card was seen.
tap-id more
tap Review settings
wait-for Card details
expect Due cards, then missed ones
tap-id details-detailed
wait-idle
expect-state /layout#/nodes/11/kind "ChoiceOption(ActionId(3421518992), true)"
clean
shot flashcards-full-settings-detailed
tap Done
wait-for Choose a deck
tap Getting started
wait-for 1 of 6
expect Recognition · 0 prior reviews
expect Reveal answer
clean
shot flashcards-full-question-detailed
tap-id answer
wait-for Magnetic north.
expect Again
expect Hard
expect Good
expect Easy
tap-id hard
wait-for 2 of 6
tap-id answer
wait-for Evaporation.
tap-id easy
wait-for 3 of 6
# Leaving half way goes back to the decks with the reviews counted, and the
# deck picks up at the next card.
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Choose a deck
expect 4 due
clean
shot flashcards-full-decks-part-done
tap Getting started
wait-for How many sides does a hexagon have?
tap-id answer
tap-id good
# The Japanese card is drawn in a face that has its characters.
wait-for こんにちは
tap-id answer
wait-for konnichiwa
clean
shot flashcards-full-japanese
tap-id good
wait-for Which planet is closest to the Sun?
tap-id answer
tap-id good
wait-for Name the four largest moons of Jupiter.
tap-id answer
wait-for Galilean moons
clean
shot flashcards-full-long-answer
tap-id good
wait-for Done for today
expect You reviewed 6 cards today.
expect Choose another deck
tap Choose another deck
wait-for Read collection again
# The licences: an index of documents, each one paged.
tap-id more
tap Licences & about
wait-for On this device
clean
shot flashcards-full-licences
tap-id notice-document-0
wait-idle
clean
shot flashcards-full-licence-document
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for On this device
tap Done
wait-for Done for today
# Sending the collection again from the computer keeps the grades.
companion flashcards push scripts/fixtures/flashcards/getting-started.cobfc --sim
lifecycle background
lifecycle foreground
wait-idle
tap Read collection again
wait-idle
wait-for Done for today
expect You reviewed 6 cards today.
# The day's reviews survive a restart, and so should the Detailed choice.
restart
wait-for Done for today
expect You reviewed 6 cards today.
tap-id more
tap Review settings
wait-for Card details
expect-state /layout#/nodes/11/kind "ChoiceOption(ActionId(3421518992), true)"
